    "description": "Presented lightning talk on Blockchain for Game Development at the Devmoot technical conference.\n\nhttps://www.knoxgamedesign.org/knoxgamedesign/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/devmoot_blockchain_for_gamedev.pdf",
