   {
    "title": "Published Games on XBox 360, XBox One",
    "description": "2017 - Released games Kitty's Adventure and Turn Back the Clocks 4 on XBox One console as free games through Creators Program.\n\n2013 - Designed, developed, and marketed the game TTY GFX ADVNTR, which was published on the XBox Live Indie Game marketplace.  TTY GFX ADVNTR puts the player in the role of a hero who must defeat the dragon to save the princess, and uses classic RPG gameplay and graphics.  Promoted the game which was reviewed by multiple gaming sites.\n\n2012 - Designed, developed, and released the game Resistor for the XBox 360 console as a part of the XBox Live Indie Game marketplace.  The objective of Resistor is to build connections to carry flow to activate electrical components. Promoted the game, which received favorable reviews by five different game review sites.",
